BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-mon-gym@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235600Z
DTSTART:20260914T063000
DTEND:20260914T071500
SUMMARY:Gym — Strength
DESCRIPTION:Back Squat 3x8\, Romanian Deadlift 3x8\, Walking Lunge 3x10/leg\, Plank 3x45s — RPE 7 (3 reps in reserve). Load = RPE/reps-in-reserve\, not a fixed kg — pick a weight where the last rep of the last set matches the stated RPE (no 1RM on file\, this self-corrects as you get stronger).
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-mon-swim@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235600Z
DTSTART:20260914T180000
DTEND:20260914T184500
SUMMARY:Swim (fun session)
DESCRIPTION:Warm-up 200m easy + drills (catch-up\, fist swim). Main set: 13x50m @ easy\, focus on technique (catch\, rotation\, breathing)\, 20s rest. Cool-down 100m easy. ~950m total (est. from your current ~21.4m/min pace).
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-tue-run@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235600Z
DTSTART:20260915T180000
DTEND:20260915T183000
SUMMARY:Run — Quality
DESCRIPTION:Warm-up 10min easy. Main: 6x2min @ tempo (RPE 6-7)\, 2min easy jog between. Cool-down 5min.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:w1-wed-gym@ironman-plan
DTSTAMP:20260914T235600Z
DTSTART:20260916T063000
DTEND:20260916T071500
SUMMARY:Gym — Strength
DESCRIPTION:Bench Press 3x8\, Bent-over Row 3x8\, Overhead Press 3x10\, Pallof Press 3x12/side — RPE 7. Load = RPE/reps-in-reserve\, not a fixed kg — pick a weight where the last rep of the last set matches the stated RPE (no 1RM on file\, this self-corrects as you get stronger).
END:VEVENT
